WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.152
Four checks happen before the needle goes anywhere near the patient.

2
00:00:04.152 --> 00:00:06.417
The expiry date on every bottle.

3
00:00:06.417 --> 00:00:10.569
The integrity of the seals - no leaks and no cracks.

4
00:00:10.569 --> 00:00:14.344
That the labels and the laboratory request form are ready.

5
00:00:14.344 --> 00:00:20.383
And that the rubber septa have been cleaned with 70 percent alcohol and allowed to dry.

6
00:00:20.383 --> 00:00:24.535
Each of these, missed, is a specimen the laboratory will reject.

